    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（あぁもうっ、ぼくの馬鹿！　部長さん、すっごい寂しそうな顔してるよ～っ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（ちがうの！　目障りとか『部長だなんて認めない』とかじゃなくて！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（すず先輩から話に聞いてて、ずっと部長さんに会いたかった！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（話したいこといっぱいあった、一緒にライブとか……やりたいこといっぱいあったのに！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（なのに、なのに～！　うまくできないっ、もどかしいよ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（どうして部長さんを迎えにくる役目が、ぼくに任されたんだろ。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（すず先輩か、そうでなくても、しずくちゃんならもっと上手にできたのに～っ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（そりゃあ、お兄ちゃんが車だしてくれるっていうから、ぼくが同伴するのが『すじ』だけど。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（何の役にも立ててないし、むしろ哀しませちゃってるし～？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（お兄ちゃんは仕事が溜まってるとかで、車のなかでパソコンいじってるし……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（他のみんなも、こういうときにかぎって姿がないしっ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（ど、どうしよう？　空気が重いよ～っ、ぼくだけじゃ無理だよ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "（この状況をどうにもできないよぉ、誰か助けて～！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「……あ、あれ？　転校生のひと、どうしてピアノを持ち上げてるの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「危ない危ないっ、こっちにこないで！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「フラフラしてる～っ、それ頭の上に落とされたら死んじゃうからっ!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "remove_character",
