    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「わぁ、力持ちね～♪　でも無理しないでね、ギックリ腰になっちゃうけれど？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「そのピアノはいいの、たしかにあたしの私物だけれど。さすがに、持ち帰るのは大変だし……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「お世話になったお礼も兼ねて、この病院に寄付するつもりだから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「そこに置いておいて、怪我しないように慎重にね。うん、上手上手♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「あぁ、懐かしいなぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「入院した当初はよく弾いてたけれど、症状が重くなってからは演奏が禁止されちゃって……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「ピアノってけっこう全身運動っていうか、重労働だからね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「ぽろん、ぽろん……♪　まだまだ現役ね、しっかり音がでる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「つゆりちゃんあたりが、調律してくれたのかしら？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「ねぇルカちゃん、ピアノは弾ける？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
