    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「じゃあ、教えてあげる。ちょっと休憩がてら、ね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「そばにおいで。ここに座って。リラックスしてね～、連弾しましょ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「音楽は、世界の共通言語。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「神さまが意地悪して、バベルの塔を崩したときに、あたしたちの言語をバラバラにしたけれど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「音楽は、そのたったひとつの生き残り」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「音楽が、バラバラの心を結びつける。あたしはそう思ってる……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「だから、あたしは歌うし奏でるの。みんなの心と繋がるための、愛のアンサンブルを」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「ルカちゃんも同じだって、信じてる。あなたも、軽音部だから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「だからルカちゃん、おいで。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「この世には怖いこと、嫌なこともいっぱいあるけど、音楽だけは裏切らない」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「長い入院生活で……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「あたしの心が摩耗して壊れそうだったとき、助けてくれたのは音楽。この、ピアノだったから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 468
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "「最後に、もういちど奏でたいの。ねぇルカちゃん、手伝ってくれる？」"
